**Shadowman** (Heroic). A once-celebrated scientist in powered armor,
hunting a banned cloning project to restore his dead daughter.
Shadowman is feared across the galaxy for the ruin he leaves behind,
though his rampage may be less random than it looks. He was once Har
Grimoire, an acclaimed scientist devoted to his daughter Elle, until a
lab accident killed her and nearly killed him. Thought dead, he
rebuilt himself inside armor that both keeps him alive and makes him
more than human, and set out to find OVA -- an outlawed project to
rebuild a person from a single DNA sample, which he's sure still
exists somewhere. He'll let nothing stop him. *Armored +2, Attack
(Futuristic Force) +3, Barrier +4, Combat Expert +1, Flight +3,
Inventor +3, Life Support +3, Pilot +2, Smart +3, Strong +3,
Telekinesis +3, Tough +4, Vigorous +2; Bizarre Appearance −2, Focus
(Abilities from Suit) −3, Infamous (Criminal) −3, Obsession (Finding
OVA) −3, Secret (Identity) −3, Wanted (GPL) −3.* Laser Sword (Armor
Piercing; Weapon): Roll 3, DX 7, End 0. A glowing beam of light that
instills fear into those who would dare face him. Psycho-Kinetic Crush
(Area Effect, Stunning; Ineffective x2): Roll 3, DX 5, End 10.
Shadowman uses his amplified mental powers to toss around the
opponent. Defense 6. Health 80, Endurance 60. TV 24.

